notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T17:16:53.271Z",codex-root,Keep live-instance testing opt-in through E2E_SEARXNG_URL.
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T17:16:53.271Z",codex-root,A mock helper provides no hermeticity unless suite setup owns its lifecycle.
  "2026-07-16T17:18:01.672Z",codex-root,Keeping the explicit environment override while defaulting to an owned mock supports both deterministic CI and intentional live-instance tests.
