close_reason: "The E2E suite is self-contained by default, preserves the live override, tears down its server, and all 60 tests pass."
body: "tests/e2e/cli.test.ts defines a complete mock SearXNG server but the suite-level setup still configures http://localhost:8080 by default. Search cases therefore fail with fetch errors on clean hosts. Start the mock during beforeAll when no explicit external endpoint is requested, route the CLI config to its ephemeral port, and close it during teardown. Preserve E2E_SEARXNG_URL as the explicit live-instance override."
